  "profile": "Sixteen authored material/phase variants: four unchanged phased canonical meadow, six wildflower/pebble/weed and six subtly worn meadow. Detail masters precisely edit canonical grass and project the complete output to768x480 with existing alpha-aware antialiased Lanczos3, retaining relative feature scale. Interior paint is65percent authored detail material plus35percent the existing phased canonical meadow. Canonical source and sampler unchanged through8worldpixels from everyedge; cubic smoothstep8..18 to interior paint. Unmasked416x352 opaque4x overscan, existing whole-image Lanczos3 to208x176, crop4worldpixels then complementary final half-open ownership. All final6worldpixel guards exactly match canonical exports at2x/4x. New botanical/pebble details are imagegen-authored, never drawn procedurally.",
